<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Cricket-Sheffield Shield standings.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Cricket-Sheffield Shield standings.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sheffield Shield standings after the final round of matches were completed on Sunday (tabulate under played, won outright, won on first innings, drawn, lost on first innings, lost outright, points):</p>
<p> Western Australia   10   6   3   0   0   1   42</p>
<p> Queensland	    10   4   2   0   3   1   28</p>
<p> New South Wales     10   4   1   0   1   4   28</p>
<p> Tasmania		10   3   2   0   1   4   28</p>
<p> Victoria		10   3   0   0   2   5   19.7</p>
<p> South Australia     10   2   0   0   1   7   14</p>
</text>
